ON JUCE

Jimothy Feral is built on JUCE 7, which travels here under its GPL-3 tier;
GPL-3 section 13 is what lets GPL-3 and AGPL-3 code convey together, and the
Affero condition rides along. If someone puts Jimothy in a render farm, the
users of that farm are owed this source.

